  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-joins-the-game-v1.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "ff979d55ed954a2180528f0da8a9c946d3b4225f00fc39835447e20cf85559b0",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1fa259ac252ec31c36ca190ab754a17688f28321487c9f984999593bd8e099d3",
      "text": "Wukong Wants\nto Play Too",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fe6aaeb144045476dae05a4738ca8e46dc5079eee933d338972278ac31c81f54",
      "text": "It is a sunny day.\nPigsy, Rabbit and Ao Bing\nplay ball.\nThey sit in a circle.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4446d23d436a77dc3a6700c80b276dba5761f191acdc2d0ebd86148f3b8ec8f3",
      "text": "Pigsy rolls the ball.\n“Roll to Rabbit!”\nRabbit catches it.\n“Roll to Ao Bing!”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5c1eb9099a15acb0eac505231d4edb93df3233cd6e46a8aac7661a02f3c5140e",
      "text": "Wukong looks from the\npeach tree.\nHe wants to play so much!\nHis toes go tap, tap, tap.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b17c5b26ec1bea7e0b9acd060b831134889c98dc24639e6f6f077a3e8e4974be",
      "text": "The ball rolls to Ao Bing.\nWukong runs in and grabs it.\n“My turn!”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5076e9031853dd687b8c71d4d11024d74c4391d8e8574fc5a75cde9467aa586d",
      "text": "The game stops.\nAo Bing’s hands are empty.\n“That was Ao Bing’s turn,”\nsays Pigsy.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e0b6b0876aca19e4fe5fe3072bfa9ca832359b2f67e5408bfca67aa9d4ddaeac",
      "text": "Wukong’s face feels hot.\nHe puts the ball down.\nHe sits on the bench by\nthe tree.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a508f8c093565d27026f0491f845dc67c9676d1177762f571e6e87274712dba7",
      "text": "Sandy comes over with\na basket.\n“I want to play,”\nsays Wukong.\n“But I don’t know how.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7504108d1ab901ab8cf73c2bc748fdde75700dc902dd1aea343a8d7c15ce52f8",
      "text": "Sandy points to the bench.\n“Can I sit with you?”\nThen Sandy waits.\n“Yes!” says Wukong.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "32ce341bd0cb62639ffe269338b6d2c77b1ba7c35e60f556edd240cc59f1ef36",
      "text": "“Look. Ask. Wait,” says Sandy.\nThey look at the\ngame together.\nRoll, catch, roll again.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bb8497855a4775f73ee6ed2a0b5bfd3928f17af574e801f7c7c1fdb368e11f93",
      "text": "Wukong walks to the mat.\nHe waits for a catch.\nThen he asks, “Can I\nplay too?”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c51942919fb791a76d652f94734c0855bde1e34b13c1baed86ca0bc04087a5f8",
      "text": "“Yes! After this turn,”\nsays Rabbit.\nWukong waits.\nThe ball rolls to Pigsy.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a80aead9c17bc9624f00d43e12e76eb46ebc6f4c31fdf3acdbacee271cb78c83",
      "text": "Pigsy scoots over.\n“Sit here, Wukong!”\nNow four friends sit in\nthe circle.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "89e81947b069dfaff69ba923443401b710a7b9768b25320b2070cb3987d4e71e",
      "text": "Wukong catches the ball.\nHe thinks. Then he rolls it.\n“Roll to Ao Bing!”\nAo Bing grins.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e41af767851875e15a89d4a65e26da8da37f3d8e004c3a06f89e518c9f6918fb",
      "text": "Wukong sees Sandy on\nthe bench.\nHe runs over.\n“Sandy, can you play too?”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4f2f0ae10d089b38b4099180446b6661d0475bbb28c4822040c6ace56c906630",
      "text": "Sandy rolls the ball\nvery slowly.\nIt stops at Wukong’s toes.\n“A sleepy ball!” says Pigsy.\nFive friends laugh and play on.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
